        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>OCR to HTML Layout Recreation</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        background-color: #fcfcfc;\n        color: #111;\n        max-width: 850px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 30px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .hw-black {\n        font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"Kaiti SC\", cursive;\n        color: #2c2c2c;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .hw-red {\n        font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"Kaiti SC\", cursive;\n        color: #b03a2e;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .paragraph {\n        line-height: 2.8;\n        font-size: 17px;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .hl-pink {\n        background-color: rgba(221, 126, 221, 0.35);\n        padding: 2px 0;\n    }\n    .ul-red {\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #b03a2e;\n        padding-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .ul-black {\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid #222;\n        padding-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .anchor-inline {\n        position: relative;\n        display: inline;\n    }\n    .note-above, .note-below, .note-right {\n        position: absolute;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n        z-index: 10;\n    }\n    .note-above {\n        bottom: 100%;\n        margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    .note-below {\n        top: 100%;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .note-right {\n        left: 100%;\n        margin-left: 4px;\n    }\n    ruby {\n        ruby-align: center;\n    }\n    rt {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        transform: translateY(2px);\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"hw-black\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2em; font-size: 17px;\">\n    第二部分：(2～17) 等粥；写八儿等吃粥的情态。又可分为(2～8)盼粥，<br>\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block; width: 5.5em;\"></span>(9～11)想粥，(12～13)猜粥，(14～17)看粥。<br>\n    第三部分：(18～19) 喝了粥；写\n    <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #d35400; border-radius: 50%; width: 1.5em; height: 1.5em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em; color: #d35400; font-family: sans-serif; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 4px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 18px;\">2</span>\n    <span style=\"font-family: 'SimSun', serif; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; color: #111;\">腊八粥</span>\n    家人与八儿吃完饭后满足的情景\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hw-black\" style=\"position: relative; margin-left: 2em; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n    <svg style=\"position: absolute; left: -2.8em; top: 0.8em; width: 45px; height: 45px; overflow: visible;\" stroke=\"#2c2c2c\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n        <path d=\"M 35,0 Q -5,0 -5,40\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" />\n        <defs>\n            <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n                <polygon points=\"0 0, 6 3, 0 6\" fill=\"#2c2c2c\" stroke=\"none\" />\n            </marker>\n        </defs>\n    </svg>\n    首句使用了排比的修辞手法，写出了无论什么年龄段的人在腊八<br>\n    粥面前都变成了嘴馋的孩子，可见腊八粥受欢迎的程度。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    1. 初学喊爸爸的小孩子，会出门叫洋车了的大孩子，嘴巴上长了<br>\n    许多白胡子的老孩子，提到腊八粥，谁不是嘴里就立时生出一种甜<br>\n    甜的腻腻的感觉呢。把小米、饭豆、枣、<ruby>栗<rt class=\"hw-black\">li</rt></ruby>、白糖、花生<ruby>仁<rt class=\"hw-black\">rén</rt></ruby>合拢<br>\n    来，<span class=\"anchor-inline\">糊糊涂涂<span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: -1em;\">↳形容腊八粥里的种类多，难以分清楚</span></span>煮成一锅，让它在锅中<span class=\"anchor-inline\">叹气似的<span class=\"note-above hw-black\" style=\"left: -2em;\">运用拟人的修辞手法，生动的↘</span></span><span class=\"anchor-inline\">沸腾着<span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: -1em;\">写出了煮粥时冒气泡发出的声音。</span></span>，单看它那叹<br>\n    气样儿，闻闻那种香味，就够咽三口以上的<ruby>唾<rt class=\"hw-black\">tuò</rt></ruby>沫了，<span class=\"hl-pink\">何况</span>是，大碗<br>\n    大碗地装着，<span class=\"hl-pink\">大匙</span>大匙朝嘴里塞灌呢！\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"hw-black\" style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 15%; margin-bottom: -15px; position: relative; z-index: 10;\">\n    夸张的修辞手法，“疯”字把喜的程度<br>\n    渲染到了极致。\n    <span style=\"position: absolute; right: 2em; bottom: -1.2em; font-size: 1.2em;\">↓</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    2. 住方家大院的八儿，<span class=\"ul-red\">今天喜得快要发疯了</span>。他一个人<span class=\"ul-red anchor-inline\">进进出出<span class=\"note-right hw-red\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; top: -1em; height: 3em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 2.2em; font-weight: 300;\">}</span><span style=\"margin-left: 2px; padding-top: 0.2em;\">动作描写</span></span><span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: 2em; width: 300px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.4;\">进出次数之多，可看出八儿内心的欢喜和迫不及待的心情。</span></span><br>\n    灶房，看到一大锅粥正在叹气，<span class=\"hl-pink ul-red anchor-inline\">碗盏<span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: -0.5em;\">↳餐具的总称</span></span>都已预备整齐，摆到灶边好久<br>\n    了，但妈妈总是说时候还早。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    3. 他妈妈正拿起一把锅铲在粥里<span class=\"hl-pink\">搅和</span>。锅里的粥也像是益发<span class=\"hl-pink\">浓</span><br>\n    <span class=\"hl-pink\">稠</span>了。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    4. “<span class=\"ul-red anchor-inline\">妈，妈，<span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: 0;\">↳两声连叫写出了八儿急切的心情。</span></span><span class=\"ul-red anchor-inline\">要到什么时候才……<span class=\"note-right hw-black\" style=\"top: -0.5em; left: 80%;\">↗表示八儿的话还没说完就被打断了。</span></span>”\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    5. “要到夜里！”其实他妈妈所说的夜里，并不是上灯以后。但八<br>\n    儿听了这种松劲的话，<span class=\"ul-red anchor-inline\"><span class=\"anchor-inline\">眼睛<span class=\"note-above hw-red\" style=\"left: -1em;\">↙神态描写</span></span>可急红了<span class=\"note-below hw-black\" style=\"left: -1em;\">↳神态描写；可以看出八儿十分急切的想吃到腊八粥。</span></span>。锅中的粥，<span class=\"ul-red\">有声无力</span>的叹气<br>\n    还在继续。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    6. <span class=\"ul-red anchor-inline\">“那我饿了！”<span class=\"note-below hw-red\" style=\"left: 3em; white-space: nowrap;\">↖语言描写 神态描写</span></span><span class=\"ul-red\">八儿要哭的样子。</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n    7. “饿了，也得到<span class=\"anchor-inline\">太阳落下时<span class=\"note-above hw-black\" style=\"left: 4em; width: 380px; white-space: normal; line-height: 1.4; bottom: 80%;\">↖“太阳落下时”与“要到夜里”相比，时间提前了，这应该是喝粥最早的时间了。</span></span>才准吃。”\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    8. 饿了，也得到太阳落下时才准吃。你们想，妈妈的命令，<span class=\"ul-black\">看羊</span><br>\n    <span class=\"ul-black\">还不够<span class=\"hl-pink\">资格</span>的<span class=\"hl-pink\">八儿</span>，难道还能设什么法来反抗吗？</span>并且八儿所说的\n</div>\n<div class=\"hw-black\" style=\"margin-left: 2em; margin-top: -5px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n    反问；八儿连看羊都没资格，没有办法反抗妈妈的命令。\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 30px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: nowrap;\">本文作者沈从文，选作课文时有改动。</div>\n    <div style=\"flex-grow: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #111; margin-left: 5px; position: relative; height: 20px;\">\n        <span class=\"hw-black\" style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 2px; left: 10px; white-space: nowrap;\">原名：沈岳焕；代表作：小说《边城》</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
